# Dockerfile 专属忽略规则：构建上下文是仓库根目录。
# 显式排除「另一套部署方案」以及所有非运行时内容，保证镜像构建不接触 deploy/vm/。
# 注：即使某些旧版 Docker 不识别 Dockerfile 专属 ignore 文件，
#     Dockerfile 中的 COPY 清单也已硬保证只有 backend/、frontend/、
#     deploy/docker/entrypoint.sh、deploy/docker/healthcheck.py 会进入镜像。
.git
.github
.workbuddy
docs
tests
deploy/vm
deploy/README.md
deploy/docker/bin
deploy/docker/dist
deploy/docker/systemd
deploy/docker/runtime
deploy/docker/README.md
deploy/docker/.gitignore
deploy/docker/compose.yaml
deploy/docker/.env
deploy/docker/.env.example
deploy/docker/Dockerfile.dockerignore
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.DS_Store
